  "description": "Retrofit consisting of replacement rear windows and front door, installation of solar panels, the demolition and replacement of the existing side return extension, installation of a rear roof\r\nterrace and a new front boundary wall.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to the first occupation of the roof terrace, hereby approved, full details of the proposed privacy screening shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved details shall be implemented prior to the first use of the terrace and retained thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises.&lt;/p&gt;"
